# The web image is built from the REPO ROOT, not from web/, because the app
# imports shared source via the `@pd/ui` alias which resolves to ../shared/ui.
# That path has to exist inside the build context.
#
# Only web/ and shared/ are needed. Everything else must stay out — the Rust
# target/ directory alone is ~17 GB, and sending it to the daemon on every
# build would be ruinous.

*
!web
!shared

# Never ship these, even from inside the directories included above.
web/node_modules
web/dist
shared/**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
